<apex:page controller="DisconnectionNoticeForDomesticController" renderAs="pdf" contentType="application/pdf">

    <div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <p>
        <strong>Date:</strong> 
        <span style="background-color: yellow;">{!todayDate}</span><br/>
    
        <strong>CA No.:</strong> 
        <span style="background-color: yellow;">{!caNumber}</span><br/><br/>
            <strong>Ref. No:</strong> R&amp;T/DISC/REMINDER/{!referenceNumber}
        </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <p>
                <strong>BP No:</strong> {!bpNumber}<br/>
                <strong>Name:</strong> {!customerName}<br/>
                <strong>Address:</strong><br/>
                {!flat}, {!floor}, {!building}<br/>
                {!street}<br/>
                {!city}<br/>
                Pin Code: {!postalCode}
            </p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; margin: 20px 0 10px; text-decoration: underline;">
                Disconnection Notice Reminder for Domestic Customer
            </p>

            <p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>

            <p>
                We would like to inform you that, effective April 2025, Mahanagar Gas Ltd. (MGL) has transitioned to a fully digital billing system. 
                Bills are now sent via email, WhatsApp, and SMS only.
            </p>

            <p>
                To ensure uninterrupted receipt of your gas bills, we kindly request you to update your latest mobile number and email ID with us at your earliest convenience.
            </p>

            <p>
                As per our records, the payment for your last bill is still pending, and the current outstanding amount on your account is 
                <strong style="background-color: yellow;">Rs. {!pendingAmount}</strong>. We kindly request you to clear the dues to avoid any disruption in your gas service.  
            </p>

            <p>
                If the payment has already been made, kindly disregard this reminder.
            </p>

            <p>
                However, we request you to please ensure your latest contact details are updated with us, if not done already.
            </p>

            <p>
                For payment and updating contact details, you may:
            </p>
            <ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
                <li>Visit our website: <a href="https://www.mahanagargas.com">www.mahanagargas.com</a></li>
                <li>Download the <strong>MGL CONNECT app</strong></li>
                <li>Call MGL Customer Care at <strong>022 6867 4500</strong></li>
                <li>Or write to us at <strong>support@mahanagargas.com</strong></li>
            </ul>

            <p>We truly appreciate your cooperation and look forward to your continued support.</p>

          <p style="color: red;"><br/><strong>FOR MAHANAGAR GAS LTD</strong><br/>Authorized Signatory</p>
         </div>

    </div>

</apex:page>